WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.834 --> 00:00:20.044
Zippy spun his tires.

2
00:00:20.045 --> 00:00:23.007
He spun them very fast.

3
00:00:23.008 --> 00:00:25.836
Mud sprayed everywhere.

4
00:00:25.837 --> 00:00:28.921
But Zippy didn't move.

5
00:00:28.922 --> 00:00:35.106
Zippy sank deeper.

6
00:00:35.107 --> 00:00:39.419
"Help!" he cried.

7
00:00:39.420 --> 00:00:43.903
"I'll help you," said Mr. Grill.

8
00:00:43.904 --> 00:00:47.170
The teacher pushed.

9
00:00:47.171 --> 00:00:51.127
Zippy moved a little bit.

10
00:00:51.128 --> 00:00:56.390
But then Mr. Grill sank too.

11
00:00:56.391 --> 00:01:03.127
"Help!" he cried.

12
00:01:03.128 --> 00:01:06.150
"Uh-oh!" said Dipper.

13
00:01:06.151 --> 00:01:09.219
Poppy gulped.

14
00:01:09.220 --> 00:01:11.804
Eddy looked at Jeb.

15
00:01:11.805 --> 00:01:15.832
Jeb looked at Eddy.

16
00:01:15.833 --> 00:01:20.477
"Let's clear that mud," said Eddy.

17
00:01:20.478 --> 00:01:24.299
The two friends moved fast.

18
00:01:24.300 --> 00:01:28.208
Shloomp! Jeb scooped the mud.

19
00:01:28.209 --> 00:01:49.405
He put it in Eddy's dumper.

20
00:01:49.406 --> 00:01:52.668
Soon everyone was free!

21
00:01:52.669 --> 00:01:55.876
"Thank you," said Mr. Grill.

22
00:01:55.877 --> 00:02:14.308
"You're welcome," said Eddy and Jeb.

23
00:02:14.309 --> 00:02:17.897
Eddy zoomed along the path.

24
00:02:17.898 --> 00:02:30.383
"I love driving off-road!"

25
00:02:30.384 --> 00:02:37.496
Zippy groaned. "I don't!"
